{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get your first taste of TerraTech Legion!</h2><br>The planet system is under threat from Legion, a vast onslaught of AI bots rampaging across the galaxy to assimilate all they encounter. As a maverick Tech jockey with nerves of steel, it's up to you to clean up the carnage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_ModularVehicleBuilding.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Build your Tech out of block components including wheels, boosters, chainsaws and orbital lasers, determining how it moves and fights. As you progress, unlock new blocks to assemble increasingly powerful and strategic builds.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_BulletHeavenSurvival.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Overcome wave after wave of deadly bots and explore the map to discover and take down Legion factory outposts \u2013 but beware the brutal boss mechs that protect them.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_FuriousMechanicalCombat.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Physics-based vehicle handling responds to your building choices as you ram through swarms of enemies at terminal velocity.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_UpgradeAugmentAdvance.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rebuild, repair and augment your Tech at mobile Upgrade Pods.<br></li><li>Discover new blocks in reward crates from destroyed enemies and Legion outposts.<br></li><li>Upgrade your core components in between waves to up your game and bring the fury.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729960?t=1749412951","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/e7d58caa53530c8a0b235ed84b4dd119dcdc7916/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749412951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/b3fcdb6a829b43beaf4cb2eca0c961e4391152f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749412951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/b3fcdb6a829b43beaf4cb2eca0c961e4391152f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749412951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get your first taste of TerraTech Legion!</h2><br>The planet system is under threat from Legion, a vast onslaught of AI bots rampaging across the galaxy to assimilate all they encounter. As a maverick Tech jockey with nerves of steel, it's up to you to clean up the carnage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_ModularVehicleBuilding.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Build your Tech out of block components including wheels, boosters, chainsaws and orbital lasers, determining how it moves and fights. As you progress, unlock new blocks to assemble increasingly powerful and strategic builds.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_BulletHeavenSurvival.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Overcome wave after wave of deadly bots and explore the map to discover and take down Legion factory outposts \u2013 but beware the brutal boss mechs that protect them.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_FuriousMechanicalCombat.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br>Physics-based vehicle handling responds to your building choices as you ram through swarms of enemies at terminal velocity.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/extras/_EN_TerraTechLegion_SteamGIFs_UpgradeAugmentAdvance.gif?t=1749412951\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rebuild, repair and augment your Tech at mobile Upgrade Pods.<br></li><li>Discover new blocks in reward crates from destroyed enemies and Legion outposts.<br></li><li>Upgrade your core components in between waves to up your game and bring the fury.</li></ul>","developers":["Payload Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3596700","name":"TerraTech Legion"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729960/1478a3b3ffb23c415b31c1323dc2079df1ce6e9f/header.jpg?t=1749412951","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141518,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141518/movie480.mp4?t=1749411772","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141518/movie_max.mp4?t=1749411772"},"name":"TerraTech Legion | Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141518/acf821beb0df703af32370b82422707b99ab4189/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749411772","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141518/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749411772","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141518/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749411772"}}],"name":"TerraTech Legion Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirement